{"version":1,"content":"<p>電子遊戲改編作品如今炙手可熱，電影和電視劇項目正處於不同的開發階段，而Netflix也想趁熱打鐵，搶佔先機。這家流媒體巨頭已經與微軟達成協議，將共同開發《戰爭機器》電影，並且還計劃收購更多Xbox的IP，打造新的系列作品。唯一的問題是?據報道，微軟的要價遠高於Netflix的預期。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583596.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:24:54.707979+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:08:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.670116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.670116+00:00","content_hash":"27b6d7772cd6ed640924f82348921995257ba3a3b6783b50539ba63f5ad6d7a8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}